{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222","id":2487635629,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f86URk6t","number":112222,"title":"unexpected field [remote_cluster] error may occur under some specific conditions when executing cross cluster search (CCS)","user":{"login":"jakelandis","id":976291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NjI5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis","html_url":"https://github.com/jakelandis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":912838879,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MTI4Mzg4Nzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Security/Security","name":":Security/Security","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Security issues without another label"},{"id":1967499607,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk5NjA3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Security","name":"Team:Security","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for security team"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-08-26T19:44:03Z","updated_at":"2024-08-27T22:38:56Z","closed_at":"2024-08-27T22:38:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Elasticsearch Version\n\n8.15.0\n\n### Installed Plugins\n\n_No response_\n\n### Java Version\n\n_bundled_\n\n### OS Version\n\nany\n\n### Problem Description\n\nElasticsearch 8.15 [introduced](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/107493) a \"remote_cluster\" concept to the Elasticsearch role. Under a specific scenario this new field may result in an error that appears:\n\n> \"reason\": {\n                            \"type\": \"parse_exception\",\n                            \"reason\": \"failed to parse role [superuser]. unexpected field [remote_cluster]\"\n                        }\n\nThe specific scenario is as follows : \n* The local cluster is on 8.15.0 (or newer versions until this bug is fixed) \n* The remote cluster is on a version before 8.15\n* Certificate based security model is in use (the elder RCS 1.0)\n* An API key is used to authenticate to the local cluster\n* The API key was created in 8.15.0 or newer\n* The API key references \"remote_cluster\" either explicitly or implicitly via the creator user's role (likely superuser) \n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n* 2 Clusters\n* 8.15.0 -> 8.14.0 (wired together via certificates, not API keys) \n* In 8.15.0 cluster, log in as a \"superuser\" (which has has the \"remote_cluster\" privilege) and create an API key\n* Execute a CCS request from the 8.15.0 cluster to the 8.14.0 cluster using the API key that implicitly references the remote_cluster\n\n### Logs (if relevant)\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"jakelandis","id":976291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NjI5MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis","html_url":"https://github.com/jakelandis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakelandis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/112222/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}